hpc:Queue a owl:Class .
hpc:Usergroup a owl:Class .
hpc:Share a owl:Class .
hpc:hasqueue a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:Hasusergroup rdfs:domain hpc:Queue .
hpc:Hasusergroup rdfs:range hpc:Usergroup .
hpc:Hasshare rdfs:domain hpc:Queue .
hpc:Hasshare rdfs:range hpc:Share .
hpc:Sharevalue rdfs:domain hpc:Share .
hpc:Sharevalue rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

hpc:Queuesubclass a owl:Class .
hpc:Queuesubclass rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Queue .
hpc:Hasdefaultshare rdfs:domain hpc:Queuesubclass .
hpc:Hasdefaultshare rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

hpc:Usergroupsubclass a owl:Class .
hpc:Usergroupsubclass rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Usergroup .


This ontology fragment defines classes for Queue, UserGroup, and Share, as well as object properties for having a queue, user group, and share, and a datatype property for the share value. It also defines subclasses for Queue and UserGroup that have a default share.
